   "id": "LUAtR23vCAAJ",
   "from": "Dan Cooke",
   "author": "ae41162d07305a52",
   "date": "2017-10-10T14:24:44Z",
   "subject": "poppr project",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello all,<div><br></div><div>  I am to perform an analysis using poppr for an advanced mycology/ population genetics class.  I am not very knowledgeable about computers but want to participate in the class and learn how to understand the power of this program.  Where will i get data to use in this package?  Thanks for any assistance.</div><div><br></div><div>be well.</div><div>Dan</div><div><br></div><div><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;border-width:initial;border-style:none;outline:none;word-wrap:break-word;color:rgb(0,0,0);width:524px;font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">sessionInfo()\r\n</span>R version 3.2.3 (2015-12-10)\r\nPlatform: x86_64-pc-linux-gnu (64-bit)\r\nRunning under: Ubuntu 16.04.2 LTS\r\n\r\nlocale:\r\n [1] LC_CTYPE=en_US.UTF-8       LC_NUMERIC=C              \r\n [3] LC_TIME=en_US.UTF-8        LC_COLLATE=en_US.UTF-8    \r\n [5] LC_MONETARY=en_US.UTF-8    LC_MESSAGES=en_US.UTF-8   \r\n [7] LC_PAPER=en_US.UTF-8       LC_NAME=C                 \r\n [9] LC_ADDRESS=C               LC_TELEPHONE=C            \r\n[11] LC_MEASUREMENT=en_US.UTF-8 LC_IDENTIFICATION=C       \r\n\r\nattached base packages:\r\n[1] stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets  methods  \r\n[7] base     \r\n\r\nloaded via a namespace (and not attached):\r\n[1] tools_3.2.3\r\n</pre></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:524px\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" width=\"1\" height=\"\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><div style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "-QfNWvnVAAAJ",
   "from": "Niklaus Grünwald",
