     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Oct 10, 2017, at 09:36 , Zhian Kamvar &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zka...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">If you want experience loading data into R from a GenAlEx formatted file, you can see part 2, section 1 of the primer: <a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/Data_Preparation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/Data_Preparation.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480692466000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0pS3h-mhYxwAzO96mb3pIQ\">https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/Data_Preparation.html</a><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">-----</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Zhian N. Kamvar, Ph. D.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Postdoctoral Researcher (Everhart Lab)</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Department of Plant Pathology</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">University of Nebraska-Lincoln</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">ORCID: 0000-0003-1458-7108</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><br></div><br></div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Oct 10, 2017, at 09:27 , Niklaus Grünwald &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">niklaus....@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Hi Dan,<div><br></div><div>We developed an open access, online primer with detailed instructions on entering data and using poppr. Please consul it at: <a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480692466000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03dhDg1aAwKsHrlJ2VABfw\">https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/</a></div><div><br></div><div>Example data sets can be found int the appendix at: <a href=\"https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/Data_sets.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/Data_sets.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480692466000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3TjAKlf6qz9pp_NZxfvuD3\">https://grunwaldlab.github.io/Population_Genetics_in_R/Data_sets.html</a>. </div><div><br></div><div>Sincerely,</div><div>Nik Grunwald</div><div><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Oct 9, 2017, at 8:04 PM, Dan Cooke &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">daniel...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><div><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello all,<div><br></div><div>  I am to perform an analysis using poppr for an advanced mycology/ population genetics class.  I am not very knowledgeable about computers but want to participate in the class and learn how to understand the power of this program.  Where will i get data to use in this package?  Thanks for any assistance.</div><div><br></div><div>be well.</div><div>Dan</div><div><br></div><div><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"padding-left:6px;padding-bottom:8px;border-style:none;outline:none;word-wrap:break-word;width:524px;font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant-ligatures:inherit!important;font-variant-caps:inherit!important;font-variant-numeric:inherit!important;font-variant-alternates:inherit!important;font-variant-east-asian:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.2;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">sessionInfo()\r\n</span>R version 3.2.3 (2015-12-10)\r\nPlatform: x86_64-pc-linux-gnu (64-bit)\r\nRunning under: Ubuntu 16.04.2 LTS\r\n\r\nlocale:\r\n [1] LC_CTYPE=en_US.UTF-8       LC_NUMERIC=C              \r\n [3] LC_TIME=en_US.UTF-8        LC_COLLATE=en_US.UTF-8    \r\n [5] LC_MONETARY=en_US.UTF-8    LC_MESSAGES=en_US.UTF-8   \r\n [7] LC_PAPER=en_US.UTF-8       LC_NAME=C                 \r\n [9] LC_ADDRESS=C               LC_TELEPHONE=C            \r\n[11] LC_MEASUREMENT=en_US.UTF-8 LC_IDENTIFICATION=C       \r\n\r\nattached base packages:\r\n[1] stats     graphics  grDevices utils     datasets  methods  \r\n[7] base     \r\n\r\nloaded via a namespace (and not attached):\r\n[1] tools_3.2.3\r\n</pre></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:524px\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" width=\"1\" height=\"\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"line-height:1.2;vertical-align:top;font-size:10.4pt!important\"><div style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div><br></div>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;poppr&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">poppr+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">po...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/poppr/7089a44d-3c23-4416-b3e0-2fb8e5bef6fd%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/poppr/7089a44d-3c23-4416-b3e0-2fb8e5bef6fd%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480692466000&amp;usg=AOvVaw227oAnG9O908s6J5Q4h6FC\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/poppr/7089a44d-3c23-4416-b3e0-2fb8e5bef6fd%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups